usage: rebis.therapeutics [-h] [--file FILE] [--stdin] COMMAND ...

rebis.therapeutics — Full Therapeutic Design Pipeline

positional arguments:
  COMMAND               Sub-command (run with COMMAND --help for details)
    design              Design a Frobenius-verified chemotherapeutic (cancer
                        vs healthy)
    sim                 Run ouroboric pill dynamics simulation
    neurotrophic        Design and simulate a neurotrophic factor
    antidote            Query universal antidote library
    quantum             Run quantum biologic prototype (NV-diamond epigenetic
                        therapy)
    list                List all exported symbols
    info                Show available tools (alias for list)
    help                Show this help message

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --file FILE, -f FILE  Input file (JSON or FASTA/sequence)
  --stdin, -i           Read JSON arguments from stdin
